 92-U -235 CIELO for testing                                      9228 1451   58
           DIST - APRIL2014                                       9228 1451   59
                                                                  9228 1451   60
 This U-235 library was created for testing benchmark results in  9228 1451   61
the thermal and epithermal energy regions. It uses JENDL4 as the  9228 1451   62
template. A resonance evaluation performed at ORNL based on cap   9228 1451   63
data taken at LANCE and RPI were used in the evaluation in the    9228 1451   64
resolved resonance region (Leal et al.). In the unresolved energy 9228 1451   65
region it uses an update done by Noguere et al.                   9228 1451   66
Preliminary results indicate improvements in calculate benchmark  9228 1451   67
in the intermediated energy region. More benchmark testing are    9228 1451   68
needed. Void reactivity calculations done by our Japanese         9228 1451   69
colleagues will be more than welcome.                             9228 1451   70
 Again, this library is for testing purpose for the WPEC/CIELO    9228 1451   71
effort. We will refer to this lib as U235_ver4.dat                9228 1451   72
                                                                  9228 1451   73
          L. C. Leal, G. Noguere                                  9228 1451   74
          ----------------------                                  9228 1451   75
                                                                  9228 1451   76
                                                                  9228 1451   77
