              P. Romain, B. Morillon, H. Duarte                   9228 1451   79
         using the TALYS code [kon07]  (version 1.4)              9228 1451   80
       The calculated fission cross section was replaced          9228 1451   81
       by the IAEA standard fission cross section.                9228 1451   82
                                                                  9228 1451   83
